WEBVTT

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.050
What manner of cartography is this?

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.600
Steady, don't burn now.

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:12.850
Watch your step, little fox.
The ink is still wet.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:15.750
Curious, isn't it?

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.800
Every path is a memory written in light.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:37.450
Wait for the silent glow to guide you home.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.550
Look closely at the dark.

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.650
The trail ends here.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.600
What secrets lie below?
